  "details": "Currently, VRChat Team can display \"Attention\" messages to everyone in the instance, in addition to notifications delivered by system via the group.\n\n```\n\n2026.01.01 02:06:06 Debug      -  [ModerationManager] The floatiness is intentional, messing with update rates\n\n2026.01.01 02:15:30 Debug      -  [ModerationManager] We're real bunched up at spawn, perhaps spread out a bit\n\n2026.01.01 02:25:09 Debug      -  [ModerationManager] I've reduce the limit, lets ge the count down to something where we can actually talk\n\n2026.01.01 02:53:35 Debug      -  [ModerationManager] I've been requested to get people to drop their reference cubes at the countdown clock\n\n```\n\nThis would be a useful feature to have for instance owners (e.g. groups), locked behind a permission (for moderators).",
